1
00:06:21,818 --> 00:06:27,818
Adventures in Lalaloopsy Land: The Search for Pillow is a
family, animation film directed by Robert Cullen.

2
00:12:43,636 --> 00:12:49,636
Peanut Big Top has a really big surprise to share with all her
Lalaloopsy friends, but Pillow Featherbed has gone missing.

3
00:19:05,454 --> 00:19:11,454
So the Lalaloopsy girls set out on an adventure, along
with their pets, to find their friend.

4
00:25:27,272 --> 00:25:33,272
With lots of unexpected surprises and challenges, including an impending thunderstorm, the
girls use creativity and their special talents, but nothing seems to work.

5
00:31:49,090 --> 00:31:55,090
Will they be able to find Pillow in time to see Peanut's exciting surprise?

6
00:38:10,909 --> 00:38:16,909
After trying almost everything, the girls realize that working
together may be the only way to find their lost friend.

7
00:44:32,727 --> 00:44:38,727
This magical adventure is full of fun and friendship and it's just sew cute!

8
00:50:54,545 --> 00:51:00,545
Boulder Media Limited is an Irish animation studio
founded by filmmaker Robert Cullen in 2000.

9
00:57:16,363 --> 00:57:22,363
It is currently a wholly owned subsidiary of Australian media company Princess
Pictures, which purchased the company in 2022 from its previous owner, Hasbro.

10
01:03:38,181 --> 01:03:44,181
The tone is lighthearted.
